{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f8e7d6c5-b4a3-2918-7654-3210fedcba98",
    "name": "Atur Perjalanan API",
    "description": "REST API collection for Atur Perjalanan backend (NestJS).\n\n**Milestone coverage:** M3 — Health, Auth, Users | M4 — Trips & Invitations | M5 — Voting | M6 — Activities | M7 — Chat & Media | M8 — Wishlist & Conversion | M9 — Notifications & Background Jobs\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection and `atur-perjalanan-local.postman_environment.json`\n2. Select the **Atur Perjalanan — Local** environment\n3. Set `google_id_token` in the environment (from Google Sign-In on mobile/web)\n4. Run **Auth → Google Sign-In** — test script saves `access_token` automatically\n5. For new users, run **Complete Registration** before other authenticated requests\n\n## Variables\n| Variable | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `base_url` | API base URL (default `http://localhost:8080/v1`) |\n| `google_id_token` / `google_id_token_2` | Google OAuth ID token for User 1 / User 2 |\n| `access_token` / `access_token_2` | App JWT for User 1 / User 2 (auto-saved after sign-in) |\n| `realtime_token` / `realtime_token_2` | Supabase-compatible JWT for Realtime WebSocket (User 1 / User 2) |\n| `username` / `username_2` | Username for User 1 / User 2 |\n| `trip_id` | Trip UUID — set after Create Trip or copy from List Trips |\n| `invitation_id` | Invitation UUID for respond/cancel |\n| `poll_id` / `option_id` / `candidate_id` | Voting IDs (copy from List Polls response) |\n| `activity_id` | Activity UUID for get/update/delete |\n| `member_id` | User UUID of trip member to remove |\n| `message_id` | Chat message UUID (auto-saved) |\n| `document_id` | Media document UUID (auto-saved from List Documents) |\n| `notification_id` | Notification UUID for mark-as-read operations |\n\n**M9:** Notifications CRUD, voting deadline reminders (background jobs), Supabase Realtime integration",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
