    {
      "name": "Health",
      "description": "Infrastructure health check (M2/M3). No authentication required.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Returns server health status.\n\n**Response 200:**\n```json\n{ \"status\": \"ok\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-12T12:00:00.000Z\" }\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Google Sign-In and username onboarding (M3).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Google Sign-In",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.access_token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
                  "        pm.environment.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (body.realtime_token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('realtime_token', body.realtime_token);",
                  "        pm.environment.set('realtime_token', body.realtime_token);",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (body.user && body.user.username) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('username', body.user.username);",
                  "        pm.environment.set('username', body.user.username);",
                  "    }",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 or 201', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Response has access_token', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('access_token');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id_token\": \"{{google_id_token}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/google",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "google"]
            },
            "description": "Authenticate with Google ID token.\n\n**Request body:**\n```json\n{\n  \"id_token\": \"google-oauth-id-token\"\n}\n```\n\n**Response 200:**\n```json\n{\n  \"access_token\": \"jwt-token\",\n  \"realtime_token\": \"supabase-jwt-token\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"user-uuid\",\n    \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n    \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n    \"username\": \"johndoe\",\n    \"avatar_url\": null,\n    \"bio\": null,\n    \"website_url\": null,\n    \"location_label\": null,\n    \"is_public\": true\n  }\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Notifications",
      "description": "Notification management and real-time updates (M9). All endpoints require authentication.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Notifications",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Response has data array', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('data');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Response has next_cursor', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('next_cursor');",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.data && body.data.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('notification_id', body.data[0].id);",
                  "        pm.environment.set('notification_id', body.data[0].id);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/notifications?cursor={{cursor}}&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["notifications"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "cursor",
                  "value": "{{cursor}}",
                  "description": "RFC3339 timestamp for pagination (optional)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20",
                  "description": "Number of items per page (default: 20, max: 100)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get current user's notifications with enriched actor/trip data. Cursor paginated by `created_at` timestamp.\n\n**Query params:**\n- `cursor` (optional): RFC3339 timestamp for pagination\n- `limit` (optional): Items per page (default: 20, max: 100)\n\n**Response 200:**\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"notif-uuid\",\n      \"type\": \"invite\",\n      \"actor\": {\n        \"id\": \"user-uuid\",\n        \"name\": \"Jane Doe\",\n        \"username\": \"janedoe\",\n        \"avatar_url\": \"https://...\"\n      },\n      \"trip\": {\n        \"id\": \"trip-uuid\",\n        \"name\": \"Bali Trip\",\n        \"status\": \"voting_pending\",\n        \"start_date\": \"2026-08-01\",\n        \"end_date\": \"2026-08-05\"\n      },\n      \"payload\": { \"invitation_id\": \"inv-uuid\" },\n      \"is_read\": false,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-07-19T10:00:00Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"next_cursor\": \"2026-07-19T09:30:00Z\"\n}\n```\n\n**Notification types:**\n- `invite`: Trip invitation received\n- `follow`: User followed you (post-MVP)\n- `voting_deadline`: Voting deadline reminder (H-7d, H-1d, H-1h)\n- `activity_update`: Activity created or modified"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Unread Count",
